          "title": "You'll want to know: યાદી",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "યાદી — yādī — \"a list\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે યાદી બનાવશો તો તમે કશું નહીં ભૂલો. jo tame yādī banāvśo to tame kaśũ nahī̃ bhūlo. If you make a list, you won't forget anything."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "યાદી (yādī) is usually traced to Persian yād, \"memory\", with the ending -ī: something written down to remember by."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
